{"page":9,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:58","surah":2,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ قُلْنَا ٱدْخُلُوا۟ هَـٰذِهِ ٱلْقَرْيَةَ فَكُلُوا۟ مِنْهَا حَيْثُ شِئْتُمْ رَغَدًا وَٱدْخُلُوا۟ ٱلْبَابَ سُجَّدًا وَقُولُوا۟ حِطَّةٌ نَّغْفِرْ لَكُمْ خَطَـٰيَـٰكُمْ ۚ وَسَنَزِيدُ ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Remember when We said, ‘Enter this town and eat freely there as you will, but enter its gate humbly and say, “Relieve us!” Then We shall forgive you your sins and increase the rewards of those who do good.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قُلْنَا","en_gloss":"We said","transliteration":"qul'nā","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱدْخُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Enter","transliteration":"ud'khulū","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِ","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْقَرْيَةَ","en_gloss":"town","transliteration":"l-qaryata","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَكُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"then eat","transliteration":"fakulū","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"wherever","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"شِئْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you wish[ed]","transliteration":"shi'tum","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَغَدًۭا","en_gloss":"abundantly","transliteration":"raghadan","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱدْخُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and enter","transliteration":"wa-ud'khulū","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْبَابَ","en_gloss":"the gate","transliteration":"l-bāba","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سُجَّدًۭا","en_gloss":"prostrating","transliteration":"sujjadan","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"And say","transliteration":"waqūlū","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":15,"ar":"حِطَّةٌۭ","en_gloss":"Repentance","transliteration":"ḥiṭṭatun","verse_key":"2:58"},{"pos":16,"ar":"نَّغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"We w